  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Thinly slice the brown onion. Grate the carrot (unpeeled). Thinly slice the long red chilli (if using). Zest the lemon to get a good pinch, then slice into wedges. If making the pickled chilli, combine the vinegar, water (for the pickle) and a good pinch of sugar and salt in a small bowl. Add the chilli and toss to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-0c4fc2d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain the sweetcorn and transfer to a large bowl.\n• Set aside. Drain and rinse the red kidney beans and keep in strainer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-3da82e9c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the onion and carrot and cook until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Stir in the red kidney beans, tomato paste, BBQ sauce, water (for the sauce) and a pinch of salt and pepper and cook until the beans have softened and the liquid is reduced, 2-3 minutes. Remove from the heat and sprinkle the shredded Cheddar cheese on top of the bean mixture to melt slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-753a16d2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the lemon zest, a good squeeze of lemon juice, the mayonnaise, a pinch of salt and pepper and olive oil (2 tsp for 2 people / 1 tbs for 4 people) to the corn. Mix to combine. Add the slaw mix and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-c1226e6a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the mini flourtortillas in a sandwich press, or on a plate in the microwave for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-40024ed8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain the pickled chilli (if using). Bring everything to the table. Build your tacos by topping the tortillas with some cheesy BBQ bean mixture, a helping of zesty slaw and pickled chilli. Serve with the remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5e719de4ff21f46e75785bb8/step-3bccceed.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
